<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
  <style>
@@STYLE@@
    .note { margin: 8px 96px 0 96px; padding: 22px 26px; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
            background: rgba(17,85,119,.10); color: var(--dim); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .note b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
    .note code { font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 20px;
                 color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</helmet>

<div style="position: relative; width: 1920px; height: 1080px;">

  <div class="strip">
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"></div>
    <div class="slot"><div class="tab">ePADD</div></div>
    <div class="slot"><div class="tab back">helm</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="padd">
    <div class="padd-bar">
      <div class="mark">e<em>PADD</em></div>
      <div class="bar-dim">TSN Artemis</div>
      <div class="bar-right">
        <div class="bar-dim">HELM</div>
        <div class="bar-dim">14:32</div>
        <div class="pill">CONDITION GREEN</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sheet">
      <div>
        <div class="group-head"><h2>Mission</h2><div class="rule"></div></div>
        <div class="grid" style="margin-top: 22px;">

          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-quests.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Quests</h3><p>Jobs offered, taken and running</p></span>
          </button>

          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-library.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Library</h3><p>Codex, lore and ship records</p></span>
          </button>

          <button class="tile">
            <img class="ico" src="epadd-help.png" alt="">
            <span class="lbl"><h3>Help</h3><p>How this console works</p></span>
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        <b>Helm registers no ship apps today</b>, so only the Mission group renders and the
        Ship heading is not drawn at all. That is the honest current state, not a gap in the
        design - Cargo, Fabricate and Upgrades belong to Engineering. A mission that wants a
        Helm app adds one line: <code>gui_app_register("navplan", consoles="helm")</code>.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exit">
      <button>RETURN TO HELM</button>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</x-dc>

<script data-dc-script data-props='{"$preview": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080}}'>
class Component extends DCLogic {}
</script>
</body>
</html>
